<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>快送外卖 - 成都本地美食，快速送达</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        header {
            background-color: #ff6600;
            color: white;
            padding: 20px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav {
            background-color: #eee;
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        nav a {
            margin: 0 10px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #333;
        }
        .category-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .category-item {
            background-color: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            padding: 15px;
            margin: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            width: 150px;
        }
        .category-item img {
            width: 80px;
            height: 80px;
            object-fit: cover;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        footer {
            background-color: #333;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 0;
            width: 100%;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

